# Origin of the Stride API (no trailing slash, no /api). EXPO_PUBLIC_ values are compiled into
# the app bundle and are public — never put secrets here.
#   Android emulator -> http://10.0.2.2:4000   (the emulator's alias for your computer)
#   Physical phone   -> http://<your-computer-LAN-IP>:4000, or the deployed HTTPS URL
#   Release APK      -> the deployed HTTPS URL (set in eas.json "preview" profile)
# Leave empty during `expo start` to derive http://<dev-machine-ip>:4000 automatically.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
